        f.write('\n\n**PROVED / COMPUTED — promotion scope.** The immutable subject above was reviewed independently. Acceptance and exact source/subject/control pins are in `'+receipt+'`. The source candidate remains unchanged. Historical review-pending wording above is superseded by this acceptance; it does not broaden the mathematical interface or claim security-category certification.\n')
